<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>ChronoPulse X1 — Next-Gen Smartwatch</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css" />
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div class="brand">CHRONO<span>PULSE</span></div>
    <nav>
      <a href="#features">Features</a>
      <a href="#specs">Specifications</a>
      <a href="#reviews">Reviews</a>
      <a href="#buy">Buy Now</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-inner">
      <div>
        <span class="hero-tag">NEW 2026 FLAGSHIP EDITION</span>
        <h1>Precision Health on Your Wrist.</h1>
        <p>Aerospace-grade titanium casing, 14-day battery endurance, and medical-grade biometric tracking built for athletes and creators.</p>
        <a href="#buy" class="btn">Pre-Order — $299</a>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-media">
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1579586337278-3befd40fd17a?auto=format&fit=crop&w=700&q=80" alt="ChronoPulse X1 Smartwatch" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="features" class="container">
    <h2 class="section-title">Engineered Beyond Limits</h2>
    <p class="section-sub">Every component optimized for clarity, durability, and endurance.</p>
    <div class="features-grid">
      <div class="feature-box">
        <h3>2000-Nit AMOLED</h3>
        <p>Crystal-clear sapphire glass display readable even under harsh midday sunlight.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-box">
        <h3>14-Day Battery Life</h3>
        <p>Ultra-efficient dual-chip architecture keeps you moving for two full weeks on one charge.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-box">
        <h3>Dual-Band GPS</h3>
        <p>Pinpoint route tracking across dense cityscapes, mountain trails, and open water.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-box">
        <h3>10 ATM Waterproof</h3>
        <p>Certified for high-speed water sports and recreational diving up to 100 meters.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="specs" class="specs-wrapper">
    <h2 class="section-title">Technical Specifications</h2>
    <p class="section-sub">Complete hardware breakdown</p>
    <table>
      <tr><th>Display</th><td>1.47" LTPO AMOLED (480 x 480 px), Always-On</td></tr>
      <tr><th>Case Material</th><td>Grade-5 Brushed Titanium with Ceramic Back</td></tr>
      <tr><th>Sensors</th><td>Optical Heart Rate, SpO2, ECG, Skin Temp, Barometer</td></tr>
      <tr><th>Connectivity</th><td>Bluetooth 5.4, Wi-Fi, NFC Tap-to-Pay, Dual-Frequency GNSS</td></tr>
      <tr><th>Weight</th><td>38g (without strap)</td></tr>
    </table>
  </section>

  <section id="reviews" class="container">
    <h2 class="section-title">Verified Buyer Reviews</h2>
    <p class="section-sub">Rated 4.9/5 by over 3,400 early adopters</p>
    <div class="reviews-grid">
      <div class="review-card">
        <div class="stars">★★★★★</div>
        <p>"The battery life is unreal. Ten days in with daily GPS runs and I still have 35% left."</p>
        <strong class="reviewer">— Rohan K., Marathon Runner</strong>
      </div>
      <div class="review-card">
        <div class="stars">★★★★★</div>
        <p>"Lightweight titanium build feels premium enough for formal meetings and tough enough for gym sessions."</p>
        <strong class="reviewer">— Sneha M., Product Designer</strong>
      </div>
      <div class="review-card">
        <div class="stars">★★★★★</div>
        <p>"Best screen brightness I have ever seen on a wearable. Zero lag in the interface."</p>
        <strong class="reviewer">— David T., Tech Reviewer</strong>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="buy" class="container">
    <div class="buy-box">
      <div>
        <h2>ChronoPulse X1 Titanium Edition</h2>
        <p class="buy-note">Includes magnetic fast charger + extra fluoroelastomer sport band.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="buy-action">
        <div class="price">$299</div>
        <button class="btn buy-btn" onclick="alert('ChronoPulse X1 added to your cart!')">Order Now</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <footer>&copy; 2026 ChronoPulse Wearables Inc. All rights reserved.</footer>
</body>
</html>
